    "detailed_description": "Your father has disappeared, and it's up to you to find him.<br>Follow his trail, encountering the furious legendary creatures he met before<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659660/extras/bedcf25d06258d19a83acfd2be5071e2.poster.avif?t=1723139974\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659660/extras/bedcf25d06258d19a83acfd2be5071e2.webm?t=1723139974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659660/extras/bedcf25d06258d19a83acfd2be5071e2.mp4?t=1723139974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The Legends Beyond Legends is an Adventure Point &amp; Click featuring foreign legends and has Pop-up book pages as stages.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659660/extras/69e1380a341972ae157dd647f95cf042.poster.avif?t=1723139974\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659660/extras/69e1380a341972ae157dd647f95cf042.webm?t=1723139974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659660/extras/69e1380a341972ae157dd647f95cf042.mp4?t=1723139974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2>\u2022\u00a0 You are a child, and with the blessings of the 3 mothers, you must follow your father's trail, confronting furious legendary creatures using your book of legends.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659660/extras/f2f443bf7ac4deb84052895c3705a101.poster.avif?t=1723139974\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659660/extras/f2f443bf7ac4deb84052895c3705a101.webm?t=1723139974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659660/extras/f2f443bf7ac4deb84052895c3705a101.mp4?t=1723139974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u2022 Pick up and use items to solve problems<br>\u2022 Choose what to say and gather information about your father's whereabouts<br>\u2022 Receive the blessings of the 3 mothers and go where no child has gone before<br>\u2022 Learn about the legends and their weaknesses to get rid of them<br>\u2022 Confront furious legendary creatures and gain new powers<br>\u2022 Find the missing fisherman and become a legend!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2>\u2022 Classic Adventure Point &amp; Click gameplay<br>\u2022 +20 scenarios that pop out of the pages like in a pop-up book<br>\u2022 10 legends from Brazilian folklore to discover and consult in the book of legends<br>\u2022 Coherent, educational, and humorous narrative with a surprising ending<br>\u2022 1-2 hours of gameplay suitable for the whole family<br>\u2022 Option of character between a boy or a girl<br>\u2022 Integrated task list so you don't lose track of your journey<br>\u2022 Original soundtrack<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACCESSIBILITY:</h2>\u2022 Custom volume controls for sound effects and music<br>\u2022 Text-to-speech feature for reading texts<br>\u2022 Customization of on-screen text size<br><br>CONTACT US:<br>Discord: <br>Instagram: <br><br>HURRY UP TO ADD THE LEGEND BEYOND LEGENDS TO YOUR WISHLIST!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659660/extras/47c555b654842e1b81c0299a09202d17.poster.avif?t=1723139974\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659660/extras/47c555b654842e1b81c0299a09202d17.webm?t=1723139974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659660/extras/47c555b654842e1b81c0299a09202d17.mp4?t=1723139974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659660/extras/08f7db369d6311fb15ad661032e3c66a.avif?t=1723139974\" width=442 height=206 /></span>",
